      },
      "worked": "The definitions require $\\cos\\theta\\ne0$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}pq&=(\\tan\\theta+\\sin\\theta)(\\tan\\theta-\\sin\\theta)\\\\pq&=\\tan^2\\theta-\\sin^2\\theta\\\\pq&=\\frac{\\sin^2\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta}-\\sin^2\\theta\\\\pq&=\\frac{\\sin^2\\theta(1-\\cos^2\\theta)}{\\cos^2\\theta}\\\\pq&=\\frac{\\sin^4\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta}\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}p^2-q^2&=(p-q)(p+q)\\\\p^2-q^2&=(2\\sin\\theta)(2\\tan\\theta)\\\\p^2-q^2&=\\frac{4\\sin^2\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}\\end{align*}$$\n\n$$\\begin{align*}(p^2-q^2)^2&=\\left(\\frac{4\\sin^2\\theta}{\\cos\\theta}\\right)^2\\\\(p^2-q^2)^2&=\\frac{16\\sin^4\\theta}{\\cos^2\\theta}\\\\(p^2-q^2)^2&=16pq\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
